cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the associated paper."
title: "GEVI Linescan Analyzer"
abstract: >-
  A single-file browser application for analysing two-photon line-scan recordings of
  genetically encoded voltage indicator signals. Extracts and photobleach-corrects
  fluorescence traces, detects action potentials and subthreshold voltage fluctuations,
  and computes synchrony, regularity, noise and entropy metrics, with a seeded
  synthetic-data validation harness.
